1      Introduction
1.1      Background
    The 2024 Paris Olympics concluded with notable highlights, including the United States
leading the medal tally with 126 medals and sharing the top spot for gold medals with China at
40 each.




                                                                    型
   As the world’s focus shifts toward the 2028 Los Angeles Olympics, the city’s vibrant energy
and cultural diversity set the stage for the historic Games.




                                                                  模
    By analysing historical data and designing predictive modeling, we aim to forecast the 2028
Olympic medal standings. The host nation, the United States, potentially reinforcing its domi-




                                                                学
nance. Simultaneously, countries that have yet to secure an Olympic medal will strive to achieve
their first victories, marking historic milestones.




                                                              数
    Additionally, the influence of great coaches and strategic investments may significantly shift
outcomes, offering valuable insights into medal prospects and performance optimization for




                                                          ：
countries worldwide.




