                                                                               The weights for each model are derived based on their relative errors:




                                                                                                                               模
                                                                                                            2                                                  2
                                                                                                         P ENN                                              P EMLR
                                                                                             wMLR =    2        2
                                                                                                                   ≈ 0.6,                         wNN =    2        2
                                                                                                                                                                       ≈ 0.4
                                                                                                    P EMLR + P ENN                                      P EMLR + P ENN




