                                                                      7.1.2    Model Construction
                                                                      The SIAMOS model integrates the four indicators to compute the importance score (ISc,s ) for
                                                                      each sport s in each country c:
                                                                                      ISc,s = α · NMPnorm + β · GCPnorm + γ · LASnorm + δ · ASDnorm
