                                                                      8.4.3    Reasons for Country and Sport Selection
                                                                      The selection of three countries (China, UK, US) and three sports (Artistic Swimming, Cycling,
                                                                      Women’s Gymnastics) creates a framework to represent global sports. It looks at differences in
                                                                      political systems and types of athletics.
                                                                            National Archetypes

